Subject: [PATCH 6.1 069/183] platform/x86: sony-laptop: Dont turn off 0x153 keyboard backlight during probe
Date: Mon, 16 Jan 2023 16:49:52 +0100
Message-Id: <20230116154806.271920769@linuxfoundation.org>
